# Control-channel script for this app's sim row (sim-run.sh::run_test, sim
# rows only). The row runs with no bridge, so the status screen is what shows;
# B (next page) twice on it must leave the pager where it is and throw
# nothing, and the row's last pattern (the first fetch classified) must still
# arrive afterwards. `wait <regex>` blocks until the log matches; every other
# line goes to the simulator's control channel as typed (`pdb input` on
# hardware).
wait ClaudeUsage[]:] page -> Claude usage
input keyevent 20
input keyevent 20
